Error [E1219]: `--profile=turbo` is not a defined build profile.
 Why: blessed profiles `release`, `debug`, and `ci` have built-in defaults. Any other name must be declared in your `package.jet` `build { }` block as `turbo: Build.{ optimize: … }`.
 Fix: use `--release` for the release profile, `--profile=debug` for debug, `--profile=ci` for CI, or add `turbo: Build.{ optimize: full }` (or `none`/`basic`) to the `build { }` block in `package.jet`.
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E1219
